Rag is very useful for building chatbots.

4230
06:12:31,342 --> 06:12:36,292
And also RAG is used to reduce LLM's hallucinations as well.

4231
06:12:36,558 --> 06:12:38,500
So we need an input document, right?

4232
06:12:39,758 --> 06:12:42,688
