4776
06:54:29,326 --> 06:54:31,696
Second one is edges E.

4777
06:54:32,558 --> 06:54:35,332
Edges define the possible transition between steps.

4778
06:54:35,886 --> 06:54:41,028
Third one is state S. State is user-defined and maintained, passed between nodes.

4779
06:54:41,774 --> 06:54:44,896
In our example, price, travel location, etc.

4780
06:54:45,486 --> 06:54:54,052
So nodes are functions that call tools, that is, travel nodes using the query engine tool, and edges connect the nodes.

